    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Hiroshima, there was an infamous shrine.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What was infamous about it, you might ask?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, the shrine contained a god of desperation.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamblers, debtors, and gacha addicts came to pray.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Second, it was being used as a parking lot.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There wasn't a trace of divinity to be found.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third, the shrine maiden couldn't care less.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She did the bare minimum. Pray, park, or leave.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As that dull shrine maiden swept the leaves,\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a shooting star shot across the night sky.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She decided, as if she believed, to make a wish.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before she could, the star crashed into her car.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Across the vastness of space, we have arrived!&quot;\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Seabed's Shining Star is a leisurely two hour read. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's almost entirely a conversation between two people. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a cup ramen, settle down, and read it in one sitting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no choices to be made, so progress as you'd like.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Hiroshima, there was an infamous shrine.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What was infamous about it, you might ask?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, the shrine contained a god of desperation.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamblers, debtors, and gacha addicts came to pray.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Second, it was being used as a parking lot.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There wasn't a trace of divinity to be found.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third, the shrine maiden couldn't care less.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She did the bare minimum. Pray, park, or leave.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As that dull shrine maiden swept the leaves,\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a shooting star shot across the night sky.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She decided, as if she believed, to make a wish.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before she could, the star crashed into her car.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Across the vastness of space, we have arrived!&quot;\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Seabed's Shining Star is a leisurely two hour read. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's almost entirely a conversation between two people. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a cup ramen, settle down, and read it in one sitting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no choices to be made, so progress as you'd like.</p>",
